OL,3,CWhat is adult social care and why does
OL,4,CAndy Burnham want to reform it?
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has pledged to reform the
OL,7,Fadult social care system, having made
OL,8,Fit one of the top priorities of his
OL,9,Fpremiership.
OL,11,FThe prime minister namechecked social
OL,12,Fcare as a long-neglected issue that
OL,13,Fthe government must "have the courage
OL,14,Fto fix" in his first speech as Labour
OL,15,Fleader earlier this month.
OL,17,FOn Wednesday, he will meet with
OL,18,FLiberal Democrats leader Ed Davey and
OL,19,Fshadow health secretary Stuart Andrew
OL,20,Fto tackle the problem "head-on".
OL,26,@uD@UOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
