PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785336505
OL,3,CWhat is adult social care and why does
OL,4,CAndy Burnham want to reform it?
OL,6,F"For decades, governments have kicked
OL,7,Fthis issue down the road because
OL,8,Fthey've seen it as too risky, too
OL,9,Fdifficult, and too complicated.
OL,10,FPoliticians might have different views
OL,11,Fbut I'm serious about fixing this
OL,12,Fissue and to do that, we have to find
OL,13,Fcommon ground and listen to others to
OL,14,Ffind a way forward," Burnham said.
OL,16,FITV News takes a deeper look.
OL,18,FWhat is adult social care?
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
