OL,3,CWhat is adult social care and why does
OL,4,CAndy Burnham want to reform it?
OL,6,FIt will suggest some "quite big"
OL,7,Fchanges to a system, Baroness Casey
OL,8,Fsaid, describing the system as
OL,9,F"patched together" and too often
OL,10,Fcreating "agony and uncertainty" for
OL,11,Fpeople at the most vulnerable points
OL,12,Fin their lives.
OL,14,FFrom Westminster to Washington DC -
